      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conowingo%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1928, a new town called Conowingo Village sprang up on the Harford County side of the dam.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
