      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conowingo%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 90‑foot drop at the rapids forced the dam’s placement, flooding the old Conowingo site under the reservoir.",
